@title: Both browsers ask for the same language
# Left to themselves, headless Chrome asked for en-US and Firefox for the
# system's language. The default is en-US on both.
STEP 1: navigator.language and Accept-Language
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/locale.html
    VERIFY that 'navigator: en-US' is present
    VERIFY that 'header: en-US' is present
DONE.
